    "text": "y100fm.com\nwebsite\nDetroit\n$5K showers down on Detroit for man’s final wish\n1 days ago\nDETROIT — A Detroit man’s last wish was fulfilled as a helicopter dropped money and rose petals over part of the Motor City. Darrell “Plant” Thomas was 58 years old when he died on June 15. His sons put together a tribute to honor their father, sending a helicopter up over Showroom Shine Express in Detroit, and showering the neighborhood with $5,000.\n1",
